---
/**
 * Footer — the colophon (owner pick 2026-08-20, lab proposal A).
 *
 * A quiet book-style end: name + serif sign-off, one mono nav row,
 * icon tiles (email + profiles), a one-line newsletter pointer, and
 * the small-print colophon strip. No iframe — the subscribe embed
 * lives on the homepage's Grug tile journey instead.
 *
 * Color rule (DESIGN-SYSTEM §5) unchanged: the footer is a no-hue
 * zone — ink, mist, muted, hairlines; accent only on hover.
 */
const year = new Date().getFullYear();

// Icon paths: simple-icons 24×24 (Medium from v16.28), drawn with
// currentColor; Email is the Material envelope, same grid.
